Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Comparison with Honet Fig. 10", "Chapter",ExpressionUUID->"4c0cc630-8635-4494-907e-ec653fe5cf7f"],

Cell["\<\
Fig. 10 of Honet+2025: binding energy in units of M for q = 14 (\[Nu] = \
14/225), \[Chi] = 0.5, 0, -0.5, each curve shifted to vanish at the left edge \
x_i of its panel. The paper gives no x_i; x_i and the right edges were read \
off a 400 dpi render of the figure by calibrating the axis ticks: x_i = \
0.091, 0.091, 0.079 (the last two match the windows of Fig. 11), right edges \
0.230, 0.170, 0.140. The figure's ISCO lines fall on xISCO[\[Chi]]. Note that \
the paper's Hybrid (red) includes the 1PA term, which this notebook does not.\
\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1a0dca94-e1ad-490a-8849-f66c7598d1c4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"nuF", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"14", "/", "225."}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"fig10", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"0.5", ",", " ", "0.091", ",", " ", "0.230", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "0.0035"}], ",", " ", "0."}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "0.091", ",", " ", "0.170", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "0.00145"}], ",", " ", "0."}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
