Cell["\<\
Reference values read off Fig. 10 (reading precision about 1 pixel, 3x10^-6 \
M): 0PA at the ISCO, PN and Hybrid at the right edge. Last column: \
ours/Fig.10 - 1.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"180e6a78-84bd-45f8-b2f1-808ec68228ef"],

